tayla: Hey team :wave: pushing a small pass for the dark console theme — concerned about focus ring visibility on card CTAs and some muted token contrast. Screenshot uploaded: https://redwood.app/s/shot.png
ben: I can repro, on 2x zoom the outline almost disappears against the gradient.
priya: Agree. Quick check shows focused outline ratio ~2.8:1 against bg — below the 3:1 target for non-text UI elements. I'll run a full sweep.
a11y-bot: Contrast scan complete: focus-outline: 2.8:1 (fail), hover-bg: 2.9:1 (fail), primary token on dark: 4.6:1 (pass). See report: /artifacts/contrast-1850001234.html
ben: Proposed minimal CSS change to try (dark theme tokens):
```css
:root[data-theme=\"dark\"] {
  --focus-ring: rgba(255,255,255,0.18);
}
.card-cta:focus-visible {
  outline: 3px solid var(--focus-ring);
  box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
}
```
ben: That bumps perceived contrast without altering layout. Thoughts on thickness? 3px felt right in the mock.
priya: Thickness OK, but please use `focus-visible` selector only. Also recommend adding an accessible name for the entire card if we make the whole card focusable: role=\"button\" aria-label=\"Open details for <item>\" tabindex=\"0\" — otherwise keyboard users only land on inner CTA and tab order gets noisy.
tayla: Good call. Right now the card isn't focusable; only the CTA is. I like making card composite for keyboard users as long as we keep semantics for screen readers.
sam: Small copy nit from support: expand CTA text to \"Open details\" instead of just \"Open\" to give more context for SR users.
priya: I'll add a short VoiceOver checklist: tab order, announceable label, focus ring color/width, and run aXe against dark pages in CI. I'll attach test cases.
ben: Also flagged that selected-state border currently sits right under the focus ring causing visual clutter. Suggest using an inset border for selected and keep focus ring outward.
tayla: Ok action items: ben -> PR with CSS token and small selector changes; priya -> add tests + run CI scan; sam -> update CTA copy; tayla -> update design token doc (rename `interactive-focus-dark` -> `interactive-focus` and document usage). We'll reconvene next Thurs in design review. Thanks! :thumbsup:
